From b9b3a907d237c34f92724954a97d3f612552d131 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Randolph <randolph@andestech.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Jan 2025 17:47:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 36/53] swdtb: spi: add DMA handshake ID and dma-names to spi
 node (#150)

To support SPI DMA mode by default, add the DMA handshake ID and
dma-names property to the SPI node.

Signed-off-by: Randolph <randolph@andestech.com>

Reviewed-on: https://gitea.andestech.com/RD-SW/u-boot.official/pulls/150
Reviewed-by: Locus Wei-Han Chen <locus84@andestech.com>
Reviewed-by: Leo Yu-Chi Liang <ycliang@andestech.com>
Co-authored-by: Randolph <randolph@andestech.com>
Co-committed-by: Randolph <randolph@andestech.com>
---
